---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro'
---
<Page title="The desk, Patrick Fanella" description="Patrick Fanella, senior backend and full-stack engineer. A tiling desk of panes on a live ink simulation, where PostgreSQL will run in your tab." bodyClass="desk" noscript={false}>
  <a class="skip" href="#about">Skip to the desk</a>

  <header class="bar">
    <a class="mark" href="/" data-bleed="y">patrickfanella.co</a>
    <nav class="tags" aria-label="Panes">
      <button type="button" data-go="1" style="--acc: var(--desk-1)" aria-label="Pane 1, about" aria-keyshortcuts="Alt+1" aria-current="true">1</button>
      <button type="button" data-go="2" style="--acc: var(--desk-2)" aria-label="Pane 2, projects" aria-keyshortcuts="Alt+2">2</button>
      <button type="button" data-go="3" style="--acc: var(--desk-3)" aria-label="Pane 3, psql" aria-keyshortcuts="Alt+3">3</button>
      <button type="button" data-go="4" style="--acc: var(--desk-4)" aria-label="Pane 4, log" aria-keyshortcuts="Alt+4">4</button>
      <button type="button" data-go="5" style="--acc: var(--desk-5)" aria-label="Pane 5, process" aria-keyshortcuts="Alt+5">5</button>
    </nav>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <a href="/#coming" data-bleed="c">What's coming</a>
      <a href="/desk/" aria-current="page" data-bleed="y">Desk</a>
      <a href="/motion/" data-bleed="o">Motion</a>
      <button type="button" class="switch" data-theme-switch data-splash="y"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="sr-only">Theme: </span><span data-theme-name>Light</span></button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wm">
    <section class="pane about" id="about" data-pane="1" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="p1">
      <header class="ptitle"><b class="pname" id="p1"><i aria-hidden="true">1</i>about</b><span>visitor@patrickfanella.co: ~</span></header>
      <div class="pbody">
        <p class="cmdline"><span class="ps1">~</span> $ whoami</p>
        <h1 id="name" class="desk-name poured" data-pour-in><span data-word>Patrick</span> <span data-word>Fanella</span></h1>
        <p class="role">Senior backend and full-stack engineer</p>
        <p class="pitch">I build and run services in Go, Python and TypeScript on PostgreSQL. At DeliverZero I built the inventory, returns and partner integrations that cut manual operations work by about 25%. Chicago or remote, and interviewing now.</p>
        <ul class="links" aria-label="Contact and code">
          <li><a href="mailto:patrick@subcult.tv" data-bleed="y">patrick@subcult.tv</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/PatrickFanella" data-bleed="c">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/patrick-fanella" data-bleed="o">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://patrickfanella.co" data-bleed="y">Current portfolio</a></li>
        </ul>
        <form class="shell" data-shell hidden>
          <label for="command"><span class="ps1">~</span> $ <span class="sr-only">Desk command</span></label>
          <input id="command" name="command" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="200" aria-describedby="shell-help" />
          <button type="submit">Run</button>
          <p id="shell-help">Type help for commands. Up and Down recall command history.</p>
        </form>
        <div class="shell-output" data-shell-output role="log" aria-label="Command output" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions" tabindex="0"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pane projects" data-pane="2" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="p2" style="--i: 1">
      <header class="ptitle"><h2 class="pname" id="p2"><i aria-hidden="true">2</i>projects</h2><span>ls ~/projects</span></header>
      <div class="pbody">
        <ol class="work">
          <li>
            <h3><a href="https://clpr.tv" data-bleed="c">Clpr</a><span>Production</span></h3>
            <p>Twitch clip search, playlists and moderation. I built and run the Go API, the React client and the search pipeline.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3><a href="https://hasanara.tv" data-bleed="o">HasanAra</a><span>Production</span></h3>
            <p>A searchable broadcast archive. I built the React frontend on Rekolekt's timestamped transcript API.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3><a href="https://undertow.subcult.tv" data-bleed="y">Undertow</a><span>Live beta</span></h3>
            <p>A music-video editor in the browser with timed lyrics and local MP4 export. I built the editor and its WebCodecs renderer.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="more-work">The rest are on the <a href="https://patrickfanella.co">current portfolio</a> until they move here.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pane psql" data-pane="3" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="p3" style="--i: 2">
      <header class="ptitle"><h2 class="pname" id="p3"><i aria-hidden="true">3</i>psql</h2><span data-pg-sub>needs JavaScript</span></header>
      <div class="pbody">
        <p class="empty"><span class="ps1">clpr=#</span>PostgreSQL starts here in a worker, loads 50,008 generated clips and times Clpr's search with and without its index. It needs JavaScript.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pane log" data-pane="4" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="p4" style="--i: 3">
      <header class="ptitle"><h2 class="pname" id="p4"><i aria-hidden="true">4</i>log</h2><span>needs JavaScript</span></header>
      <div class="pbody">
        <p class="empty">Startup events and measured times appear here when JavaScript is enabled.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pane process" data-pane="5" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="p5" style="--i: 4">
      <header class="ptitle"><h2 class="pname" id="p5"><i aria-hidden="true">5</i>process</h2><span>needs JavaScript</span></header>
      <div class="pbody">
        <p class="empty">Live ink and PostgreSQL statistics appear here when JavaScript is enabled.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="foot">
    <p>Alt+1 to Alt+5 move focus between panes.</p>
    <nav aria-label="Elsewhere">
      <a href="/" data-bleed="y">Home</a>
      <a href="/motion/" data-bleed="o">Motion set</a>
    </nav>
  </footer>
  <Fragment slot="head"><script>import '../../desk/desk.ts'</script></Fragment>
</Page>
